1
00:00:00,827 --> 00:00:02,397
(Leonard:)Okay, never mind.

2
00:00:03,228 --> 00:00:05,298
(Dave:)Amy, I'm never washing
this hand again.

3
00:00:05,298 --> 00:00:07,968
(Leonard:)You really should.

4
00:00:09,134 --> 00:00:11,804
60 seconds.

5
00:00:11,804 --> 00:00:13,074
(Raj:)This is not looking good.

6
00:00:13,072 --> 00:00:15,042
(Sheldon:)One minute is
a long time.

7
00:00:15,041 --> 00:00:18,071
(Howard:)I've been telling women that
for 20 years.

8
00:00:20,746 --> 00:00:23,486
(Sheldon:)45.
45 seconds is

9
00:00:23,483 --> 00:00:25,813
(Sheldon:)plenty of time for a woman
to walk through that door

10
00:00:25,818 --> 00:00:27,188
(Sheldon:)and fall in love with me.

11
00:00:27,186 --> 00:00:30,286
(Sheldon:)You know, probably half that
if I break out the old cow eyes.

12
00:00:31,123 --> 00:00:32,593
30 seconds.

13
00:00:32,592 --> 00:00:34,062
(Sheldon:)Uh-oh.

14
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,660
(Sheldon:)What if it's Jennifer Lawrence?

15
00:00:36,662 --> 00:00:37,932
(Sheldon:)What?

16
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:40,230
Oh, that last Hunger Games
was not my cup of tea.

17
00:00:40,233 --> 00:00:43,133
(Howard:)You thought she was great
in X-Men.

18
00:00:43,136 --> 00:00:44,566
(Sheldon:)Oh, fine... I won't shut my heart

19
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:46,170
(Sheldon:)to the love
of Jennifer Lawrence.

20
00:00:47,406 --> 00:00:50,456
Guys, 15 seconds.
Maybe she's waiting to show up

21
00:00:50,454 --> 00:00:52,244
(Howard:)at the last possible moment.
(groans)

22
00:00:52,245 --> 00:00:53,615
(Sheldon:)Sounds like a drama queen.

23
00:00:53,613 --> 00:00:57,483
(Sheldon:)Oh, no.
It is Jennifer Lawrence.

24
00:00:58,216 --> 00:00:59,016
(Amy:)Five...

25
00:00:59,018 --> 00:01:00,388
(Dave:)four...

